      "name": "Contact Section",
      "settings": {
        "content": "<p>We’re here to help and best of all, it’s completely free. If you haven't yet reviewed our <a href=\"/pages/faq\" title=\"FAQ\">FAQ page</a>, we recommend you do so, you might find your answer there.<br/><br/>For all online order enquiries you can chat with our Customer Care via the live chat, <a href=\"tel:0402376787\" title=\"tel:0402376787\">call</a> us, or we also recommend using our contact form, we are pretty quick to respond. If you have a query about something physical store related, you can call our stores directly <a href=\"/pages/stores\" title=\"Stores\">here</a>.<br/><br/>Customer Care Line Hours:<br/>Mon - Fri, 9am - 5pm AEDT<br/><br/>Email & Chat Hours:<br/>Mon - Fri, 9am - 8pm AEDT<br/>Saturday, 10:30am - 6:30pm AEDT<br/><br/>You can also find us on <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/crumpler/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.instagram.com/crumpler/\">Instagram</a>, <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/crumplerofficial/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.facebook.com/crumplerofficial/\">Facebook</a> & <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@crumpler_au\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@crumpler_au\">Tik Tok</a>.</p>",
